  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">SECAM 17th Plenary Assembly support</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support for SECAM.
SECAM holds its Plenary Assembly every three years with the venue rotating from one region/country to another. The 17th Plenary Assembly will take place in Luanda, Angola, 18 -25 July, with the theme &quot;The Family in Africa yesterday, today and tomorrow: in the light of the Gospel&quot;.</narrative>
  </description>
